          "item": {
            "@type": "NewsArticle",
            "headline": "Paytm Posts First-Ever Annual Profit of Rs 552 Crore in FY26 After Years of Losses",
            "articleSection": "Daily Utility",
            "abstract": "Digital payments leader Paytm has recorded its first-ever full-year net profit of Rs 552 crore in FY26, swinging from significant losses in prior years. The turnaround was driven by disciplined cost control and a 22% rise in operating revenue to Rs 8,437 crore, with financial services emerging as the primary growth engine. The milestone is significant for India's fintech sector, signalling that large-scale digital payments platforms can achieve sustainable profitability after extended investment phases.",
            "url": "https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/tech/technology/paytm-closes-fy26-with-net-profit-of-rs-552-crore-swinging-from-losses/articleshow/130862390.cms",
            "publisher": {
